WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.894
There is a big tent.

2
00:00:08.895 --> 00:00:17.202
I see elephants.

3
00:00:17.203 --> 00:00:25.535
There are lions.

4
00:00:25.536 --> 00:00:33.810
I see a juggler.

5
00:00:33.811 --> 00:00:42.164
There is popcorn.

6
00:00:42.165 --> 00:00:50.473
I see a tall man.

7
00:00:50.474 --> 00:00:59.291
There are silly clowns.

8
00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:06.619
Where am I?

9
00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:14.855
I am at the circus.

